        "Description": "Welcome 47,\r\ron your trip Home from Hokkaido, we need you to take a detour to the ancestral Carlisle estate in Dartmoor. Tensions among the household staff have escalated into sabotage, blackmail, and murder.\r\rWhat began as petty rivalry now threatens to expose powerful secrets tied to the family fortune. We have been contracted to quietly eliminate the key instigators and restore order before the feud tears the manor apart.\r\rGood Luck.",
